{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08255","headline":"述德兼陈情上哥舒大夫 · 李白","name":"述德兼陈情上哥舒大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天爲国家孕英才，森森矛戟拥灵台。\n浩荡深谋喷江海，纵横逸气走风雷。\n丈夫立身有如此，一呼三军皆披靡。\n卫青谩作大将军，白起真成一竖子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}